sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Doctor
    participant AP as Staff Panel
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over D,DB: Login
    D->>AP: Enter credentials
    AP->>BE: POST /api/doctor/login
    BE->>DB: Validate doctor
    BE-->>AP: JWT token (dtoken)

    Note over D,DB: Set Available Time
    D->>AP: Configure schedule
    AP->>BE: Admin updates via /api/admin/change-availability
    BE->>DB: Save schedule & slots

    Note over D,DB: View Appointments
    D->>AP: Open appointments
    AP->>BE: GET /api/doctor/appointments
    BE->>DB: Query appointments
    BE-->>AP: Appointment list

    Note over D,DB: Update Patient Medical History
    D->>AP: Edit medical history
    AP->>BE: POST /api/doctor/patient-medical-history
    BE->>DB: Update patient record

    Note over D,DB: Add Medication & Complete
    D->>AP: Add prescription details
    AP->>BE: POST /api/doctor/complete-appointment
    BE->>DB: Save prescription & mark Finished
    BE-->>AP: Success
